# Runtime state. main ignores these caches; hf-deploy commits them so a fresh Space starts
# warm (.sentiment_history.csv, models/data/features_*, data/generation_cache_v2.csv).
# Version 1 of the coal cache overstated generation fourfold and is never shipped.
data/generation_cache.csv
# model weights excluded on hf-deploy: HF rejects binary files (Xet policy)
# weights are committed on main for Streamlit Cloud live inference
models/weights/*.pt
models/weights/*.joblib

